To refactor the matcher implementation in Google Mock, we can focus on improving code clarity, maintainability, and possibly reducing redundancy. Below is a proposed refactor for the `GreaterThanMatcher` class to better utilize modern C++ features and enhance readability without changing the existing functionality.

#### Refactored Code in `gmock-matchers_test.h`

```cpp
// Copyright 2007, Google Inc.
